<concept id="t00319">
	<title>Luggage room lamp</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>interior lights 
					<indexterm>luggage room lamp</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
				<indexterm>luggage room lamp</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02401">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry>
							<fig id="e02402">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV035058.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e02403"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul id="e02404">
			<li>
				<p>(<image href="../../images/WKIA_070.eps" scale="15" id="e02405"/>): The lamp always turns on when the tailgate is opened or closed.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>(<image href="../../images/OMQ4A035346.eps" scale="15" id="e02406"/>): The lamp turns on when the tailgate is opened and turns off when the tailgate is closed.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>(<image href="../../images/WKIA_073.eps" scale="15" id="e02407"/>): The lamp always remains off, regardless of tailgate operation.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="caution">
			<p>The luggage room lamp turns on whenever the tailgate is open. To prevent unnecessary battery discharge, always close the tailgate securely after use.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
